Removing photos deletes their figures, with their captions: both of
photo 1's, and photo 2's. A remote ID without a figure is confirmed too.
-- request.json --
{
	"protocol": 5,
	"op": "delete",
	"collection": 10,
	"remoteIds": [
		"a1000000000000000000000000000001.jpg",
		"b2000000000000000000000000000002.jpg",
		"e5000000000000000000000000000005.jpg"
	]
}
-- vault/Galleries/Recent.md --
---
cssclasses:
  - image-grid
lightroom-collection: 10
lightroom-path: Recent
---

[![](Galleries/Attachments/thumbs/a1/a1000000000000000000000000000001.jpg)](vaultsite-fullsize:cat/a1/a1000000000000000000000000000001)
Captioned

[![Sunset](Galleries/Attachments/thumbs/b2/b2000000000000000000000000000002.jpg)](vaultsite-fullsize:cat/b2/b2000000000000000000000000000002)

[![](Galleries/Attachments/thumbs/c3/c3000000000000000000000000000003.jpg)](vaultsite-fullsize:cat/c3/c3000000000000000000000000000003)

[![removed](Galleries/Attachments/thumbs/a1/a1000000000000000000000000000001.jpg)](vaultsite-fullsize:cat/a1/a1000000000000000000000000000001)
-- want/response.json --
{
	"protocol": 5,
	"confirmed": [
		"a1000000000000000000000000000001.jpg",
		"b2000000000000000000000000000002.jpg",
		"e5000000000000000000000000000005.jpg"
	]
}
-- want/log --
Galleries/Recent.md: deleted 3 figures of 3 removed photos
-- want/vault/Galleries/Recent.md --
---
cssclasses:
  - image-grid
lightroom-collection: 10
lightroom-path: Recent
---

